cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ScaleGuard-4K, cite this software and the 4KAgent and
  Chain-of-Zoom papers listed below.
title: "ScaleGuard-4K: Degradation-Aware Agentic Restoration with Scale- and Measurement-Consistent Extreme Super-Resolution"
type: software
authors:
  - name: ScaleGuard-4K contributors
version: 0.1.0.dev0
repository-code: "https://github.com/liuqjjin/scaleguard-4k"
url: "https://github.com/liuqjjin/scaleguard-4k"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A research-engineering framework for evidence-driven scale control under
  compound image degradations. It records explicit quality, cross-scale, and
  measurement-consistency decisions for every candidate scale transition,
  together with reproducible runtime and artifact provenance.
keywords:
  - image restoration
  - extreme super-resolution
  - vision-language models
  - agentic imaging
  - computational imaging
